1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Backstop turns a medical denial into a cited appeal you control.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Drafts and sends the appeals you approve — not legal or medical advice.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:28,000
A sample case attaches a fictional denial letter and EOB. No real PHI.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Firecrawl parses and researches policy. OpenAI drafts from stored sources.

5
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Unsupported claims stay marked unverified. Citations point at the evidence.

6
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Approve is the only send gate. Record shows Firecrawl, OpenAI, and AgentMail.

7
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:45,000
A fictional payer reply still needs your approval before anything sends again.

8
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Watch arms a deadline and fills a public form — submit is never clicked.

9
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:30,000
One case type: medical denials. Human approval is the backstop.
